  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Garanti med Green for Growth Fund: V&#xe4;stra Balkan och &#xd6;steuropa</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Guarantee to the Green for Growth Fund: Western Balkans and Eastern Europe - Guarantee subsidy to the Green for Growth Fund: Western Balkans</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Portfolio guaratee to the Green for Growth Fund to enable green lending to financial institutions and corporates in Western Balkan and Eastern Partnership regions.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Portf&#xf6;ljgaranti till Green for Growth Fund f&#xf6;r gr&#xf6;n utl&#xe5;ning till finansiella institut och stora bolag i V&#xe4;stra Balkan och &#xd6;steuropa.</narrative>
  </description>
